13→### Noise Displacement Along Normal
14→```vex
15→float amp = chf("amplitude");
16→float freq = chf("frequency");
17→float n = snoise(@P * freq + @Time * chf("speed"));
18→@P += @N * n * amp;
19→```
20→
21→### Twist Deformation
22→```vex
23→float twist_amount = chf("twist") * @P.y;
24→float c = cos(twist_amount);
25→float s = sin(twist_amount);
26→float x = @P.x * c - @P.z * s;
27→float z = @P.x * s + @P.z * c;
28→@P.x = x;
29→@P.z = z;
30→```
31→
32→### Taper via Ramp
33→```vex
34→float taper = chramp("taper_profile", fit(@P.y, chf("ymin"), chf("ymax"), 0, 1));
35→@P.x *= taper;
36→@P.z *= taper;
37→```
