39→## Color Patterns
40→
41→### Color by Height
42→```vex
43→float t = fit(@P.y, chf("min_height"), chf("max_height"), 0, 1);
44→@Cd = chramp("color_ramp", t);
45→```
46→
47→### Color by Curvature
48→```vex
49→int pts[] = neighbours(0, @ptnum);
50→float curvature = 0;
51→foreach (int pt; pts) {
52→    vector n2 = point(0, "N", pt);
53→    curvature += 1.0 - dot(@N, n2);
54→}
55→curvature /= max(len(pts), 1);
56→@Cd = chramp("curvature_ramp", curvature);
57→```
